OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to step in to fund #16k
OL,4,Asea wall art
OL,5,
OL,6,FDouglas City Council is to step in and
OL,7,Fspend #16,000 from its reserves on
OL,8,Fpublic artwork for the promenade sea
OL,9,Fwall after the Department of
OL,10,FInfrastructure (DOI) failed to include
OL,11,Fit in its budget.
OL,13,FThe authority said the money would
OL,14,F"protect" local artists whose work was
OL,15,Falready commissioned for the wall and
OL,16,Fbring "vibrancy" to the city.
OL,18,FThe Department of Infrastructure said
OL,19,Fthe cost of the scheme was
OL,20,F"accidentally left out of its own
OL,21,Fbudget".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
