OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to step in to fund #16k
OL,4,Asea wall art
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Devon Watson said the
OL,7,Fsea defence wall was "an important
OL,8,Fpiece of infrastructure" and that the
OL,9,Fartwork would "help transform it into
OL,10,Fan attractive public feature that
OL,11,Freflects the character of our city."
